<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the</p>
<p>third day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>At Discovery Bay, Jamaica: Barbados beat Jamaica by 121</p>
<p>runs. Barbados 184 and 223. Jamaica 180 and 106.</p>
<p>At The Valley, Anguilla: Leeward Islands 168 and 195-7</p>
<p>(K.Arthurton 93 not out). Windward Islands 199.</p>
<p>At Port of Spain: Trinidad and Tobago 305 and 149-3 (B.Lara</p>
<p>72). Guyana 241 (D.Ramnarine 5-69)</p>
</text>
